The Oculum Convox is a convox of [[Geography/Færrin/Calaria/index|Calaria]]. Its [[Phenomena/Hearts|Heart]] is [[Org/Oculum Convox/Ethics Gradient|Ethics Gradient]], which joined [[Org/Actinium Convox/Gray Area|Gray Area]] of the [[Org/Actinium Convox/index|Actinium Convox]] to coordinate the Final Dawn project.
